# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This site is PUBLIC. Restricted research data must never enter this repository.
# Only publicly-licensed, non-identifiable atlas products belong here — the
# MorphBrain demo assets are CC0-1.0 dHCP fetal surface atlas derivatives
# (see third-party-notices.html). Raw subject MRI is confidential and
# non-redistributable.
# Nothing currently tracked matches these patterns; they are prevention, not cleanup.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Neuroimaging volume formats
*.nii
*.nii.gz
*.dcm
*.mgz
*.mgh

# Neuroimaging surface / tractography formats
# NB: *.gii also blocks atlas GIFTIs. Nothing tracked matches today (published
# meshes are .glb). If an atlas GIFTI is ever published deliberately, whitelist
# it by path (e.g. !demos/morphbrain/atlas/**/*.gii) rather than dropping the rule.
*.gii
*.surf.gii
*.trk

# Diffusion gradient tables
*.bval
*.bvec

# BIDS subject / session directories
sub-*/
ses-*/
